<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA 280-4 V INDIA AT CLOSE IN SECOND TEST.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA 280-4 V INDIA AT CLOSE IN SECOND TEST.</headline>
<dateline>CAPE TOWN 1997-01-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa were 280 for four</p>
<p>at the close of the first day of the second test against India</p>
<p>on Thursday.</p>
</text>
